  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a current issue where a user is unable to tell if someone is logged in using a Standalone system like the Quest or if they are on PC using Steam VR.\nI request that there be an indicator once more to help people distinguish between Standalone and PC users so people aren't sending invites to 'Questies' to join PC only worlds.\nThis issue is similar to this internally tracked issue: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1142-feedback-dont-allow-invites-to-players-on-unsupported-platform\nThe issue isn't just that people keep sending invites to those on unsupported platforms and I agree with the above feature to be added, however I also believe that we should be given an indication about what platform a user is on so we don't make the mistake of inviting them in the first place. I have friends that flip between using a Quest and PC versions of VRChat. Right now I have no indication as to what platform they're on.",
